itch so Saybil and the gang can begin the field program and avoid expulsion?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/su0cAgVCEFVelDepwGmvRVCiQOo.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Saybil and Professor Los are face to face with the witch who took over the field program village, but Professor Los has had her magic staff stolen from her, and Saybil still can't control his magic. Can they find a way to defeat the witch so Saybil and the gang can begin the field program and avoid expulsion?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/su0cAgVCEFVelDepwGmvRVCiQOo.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16280","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"133175","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"48842","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"124363","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"401920","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"61601","synopsis":"Saybil and the gang have finally begun their field program activities. However, Saybil's focus on supporting Hort and Kudo has caused him to isolate himself and neglect honing his magical talents. Professor Los hatches a plan to get Saybil to venture beyond his shop and interact with the world he knows so little about.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wwoYs763S2bKkrI9UliF4ZWGoNP.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Saybil and the gang have finally begun their field program activities. However, Saybil's focus on supporting Hort and Kudo has caused him to isolate himself and neglect honing his magical talents. Professor Los hatches a plan to get Saybil to venture beyond his shop and interact with the world he knows so little about.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wwoYs763S2bKkrI9UliF4ZWGoN